/-!
# Genuine entire polynomial approximation on smaller closed bidiscs

Finite geometric Cauchy kernels give explicit finite double-sum polynomials
whose error is uniformly bounded by a constant times `(r/R)^N`.  The actual
bounded double-circle integral turns the kernel bound into a function bound.
This proves approximation to every positive tolerance on smaller closed
bidiscs and on the original normed covering space `ComplexPlane₂`.
-/
